---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import GoogleBusinessInfo from '../../components/GoogleBusinessInfo.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';

const title = 'North Iowa Drain Cleaning & Sewer Service | A-1 Drain Cleaning';
const description = 'A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and serves North Iowa with drain cleaning, main drain cleaning, sewer line cleaning, floor drain backup service, root cutting, and 24/7 emergency service. Call 641-530-2728.';
---

<MainLayout title={title} description={description} path="/iowa-drain-cleaning/">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="bg-[#1A1A68] text-white">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 py-14 sm:py-18 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-center lg:py-20">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-red-300">A-1 Drain Cleaning • Mason City, Iowa</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[.98] tracking-tight sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">North Iowa Drain Cleaning &amp; Sewer Service</h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City and serves North Iowa communities with drain and sewer cleaning. This page is for homeowners and businesses checking whether we serve their area and what type of drain problem we handle.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-slate-200">We do not claim to serve every part of Iowa. If your town is not listed below, call and give us the address so we can confirm whether it is within our service area.</p>
          <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="mt-8 inline-block rounded-md bg-[#c52b34] px-7 py-4 text-center text-lg font-black text-white hover:bg-[#a82129]">CALL 641-530-2728</a>
          <p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">Drain cleaning • Main drains • Sewer lines • Root cutting • Hydro-jetting • 24/7 service</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="border border-white/15 bg-white/10 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-red-200">Need to know if we serve you?</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black leading-tight">Start with your town.</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-200">Our published service-area pages cover the North Iowa communities listed below. Each page gives local information and connects to the drain and sewer services most relevant to that area.</p>
          <a href="/service-area/" class="mt-6 inline-flex font-black text-white underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">View all service-area information →</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">What A-1 Drain Cleaning handles</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Drain and sewer problems across North Iowa</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">The regional page gives you the big picture. The individual service pages go into the specific problem, warning signs, and service involved. Use the page that best matches what is happening at the property.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Main Drain Cleaning</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">When multiple fixtures are affected or wastewater is backing up through a low drain.</p>
            <a href="/services/main-drain-cleaning/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Main drain service →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Sewer Line Cleaning</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For blocked or repeatedly troublesome sewer lines serving the property.</p>
            <a href="/services/sewer-line-cleaning/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Sewer line service →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/basement-floor-drains/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Floor Drain Backups</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For water or sewage coming up through a basement floor drain.</p>
            <a href="/services/basement-floor-drains/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Floor drain service →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/sewer-backup-into-tub-shower/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Sewer Backup into a Tub or Shower</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">A common way a main drain or sewer problem can show up in a home without a basement.</p>
            <a href="/services/sewer-backup-into-tub-shower/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">See sewer backup service →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/tree-roots-in-sewer-line/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Tree Roots in Sewer Lines</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">For recurring sewer blockages where roots may be entering the line.</p>
            <a href="/services/tree-roots-in-sewer-line/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Root service →</a>
          </article>
          <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-950"><a href="/services/hydro-jetting/" class="hover:text-[#b4232b]">Hydro-Jetting</a></h3>
            <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">Water-jet cleaning for suitable drain and sewer lines when the pipe and blockage call for it.</p>
            <a href="/services/hydro-jetting/" class="mt-4 inline-flex font-black text-[#b4232b] underline decoration-2 underline-offset-4">Hydro-jetting details →</a>
          </article>
        </div>
        <a href="/services/" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-md bg-[#1A1A68] px-6 py-3 font-black text-white hover:bg-slate-800">See all drain &amp; sewer services</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-14 sm:py-18">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">Where we work</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Mason City and North Iowa communities</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City. The published city pages below identify communities where we have dedicated local service information. Select your town to see the local page, or use the service-area page for the broader directory and map.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <a href="/service-area/mason-city/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Mason City, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/clear-lake/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Clear Lake, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/charles-city/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Charles City, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/forest-city/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Forest City, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/garner/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Garner, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/northwood/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Northwood, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/hampton/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Hampton, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/nora-springs/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Nora Springs, Iowa</a>
          <a href="/service-area/rockwell/" class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 font-black text-slate-950 hover:border-[#b4232b] hover:text-[#b4232b]">Rockwell, Iowa</a>
        </div>
        <a href="/service-area/" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-md bg-[#1A1A68] px-6 py-3 font-black text-white hover:bg-slate-800">Open the full service-area page →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-18">
      <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">When the problem is urgent</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Sewer backups do not wait for business hours.</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">If wastewater is coming up through a floor drain, several fixtures are backing up, or a sewer backup is reaching a tub or shower, stop adding water to the system and call A-1 Drain Cleaning.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning offers 24/7 drain and sewer service. Call <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-black text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> and tell us your town and what is happening.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">What to tell us when you call</h2>
          <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3 leading-7 text-slate-700">
            <li><strong class="text-slate-950">Your town:</strong> where the property is located.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-slate-950">The affected fixture:</strong> floor drain, toilet, sink, tub, shower, or laundry drain.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-slate-950">What else is happening:</strong> one fixture or several fixtures backing up.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-slate-950">Timing:</strong> whether it happened suddenly or has been getting worse.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-slate-100 py-14 sm:py-18" aria-labelledby="north-iowa-faq">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#b4232b]">North Iowa service questions</p>
        <h2 id="north-iowa-faq" class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">Questions about our service area</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Where is A-1 Drain Cleaning based?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">A-1 Drain Cleaning is based in Mason City, Iowa, and serves North Iowa communities. Call <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> if you need to confirm service for your address.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Do you serve outside Mason City?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Yes. A-1 Drain Cleaning serves North Iowa communities beyond Mason City. The published city pages above show the communities with dedicated local pages, and the service-area page provides the broader directory.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">Do you provide 24/7 drain and sewer service?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">Yes. A-1 Drain Cleaning offers 24/7 drain and sewer service. Call <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a> when you need service.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="border border-slate-300 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer text-lg font-black text-slate-950">What if my town is not listed?</summary>
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-slate-700">The published city pages are not a complete list of every address we may serve. Call <a href="tel:+16415302728" class="font-bold text-[#b4232b] underline underline-offset-2">641-530-2728</a>, give us the town or address, and we can confirm whether it is within our service area.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <ContactCTA showForm />
    <GoogleBusinessInfo />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</MainLayout>
